1
00:00:06,339 --> 00:00:07,466
Come on, let's hang

2
00:00:07,467 --> 00:00:08,633
out a little longer.

3
00:00:08,633 --> 00:00:09,718
Let's go now.

4
00:00:09,718 --> 00:00:11,636
Oh, just a little bit more.

5
00:00:11,761 --> 00:00:13,365
So, are things still rocky

6
00:00:13,366 --> 00:00:14,389
with your team leader?

7
00:00:14,389 --> 00:00:15,932
No, it's gotten a bit better.

8
00:00:16,224 --> 00:00:16,987
I don't get stuck with

9
00:00:16,988 --> 00:00:17,851
the tough jobs anymore.

10
00:00:17,851 --> 00:00:19,185
Really?

11
00:00:19,185 --> 00:00:20,403
Things aren't bad

12
00:00:20,404 --> 00:00:21,813
between you two, then.

13
00:00:22,188 --> 00:00:23,367
But did you see

14
00:00:23,368 --> 00:00:24,441
that look earlier?

15
00:00:26,192 --> 00:00:26,985
What look?

16
00:00:27,152 --> 00:00:28,319
You didn't notice?

17
00:00:28,486 --> 00:00:30,530
She was staring like this.

18
00:00:30,697 --> 00:00:31,697
Really?

19
00:00:32,157 --> 00:00:33,366
I didn't notice.

20
00:00:33,700 --> 00:00:35,076
Could it be jealousy?

21
00:00:35,076 --> 00:00:36,119
Jealousy?

22
00:00:36,119 --> 00:00:36,828
Why?

23
00:00:36,828 --> 00:00:37,828
I have no idea.

24
00:00:37,871 --> 00:00:40,123
Maybe she has a thing for you.

25
00:00:40,123 --> 00:00:41,498
Jealous of peers being

26
00:00:41,499 --> 00:00:43,126
friendly? That's nonsense.

27
00:00:43,543 --> 00:00:44,878
Just a few days ago

28
00:00:44,878 --> 00:00:45,855
she was practically

29
00:00:45,856 --> 00:00:46,963
growling at me.

30
00:00:47,714 --> 00:00:49,049
Anyway

31
00:00:49,340 --> 00:00:50,717
can I have some of this too?

32
00:00:51,843 --> 00:00:52,886
Not today.

33
00:00:52,886 --> 00:00:54,387
Maybe next time.

34
00:00:54,554 --> 00:00:56,181
I'm back.
